\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Vaults_of_the_Artificers\" title=\"Vaults of the Artificers\">Vaults of the Artificers</a></b>, Turn in various ingredients\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Weaken_Construct\" title=\"Weaken Construct\">Weaken Construct</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Weaken_Construct\" title=\"Weaken Construct\">Weaken Construct</a>:</b> While wearing this item, your attacks cause <a href=\"/page/Construct\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Construct\">constructs</a> to lose 20% of their <a href=\"/page/Fortification\" title=\"Fortification\">Fortification</a> for the next 20 seconds. This effect does not stack with itself.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Sonic Lore +8%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Sonic Lore +8</a>:</b> Passive: Your Sonic spells gain a 8% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Resonance\" title=\"Resonance\">Resonance +54</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Resonance\" title=\"Resonance\">Resonance +54</a>:</b> Passive: +54 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Sonic <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Blasting_Chime_(level_3).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Blasting_Chime_%28level_3%29.png/420px-Blasting_Chime_%28level_3%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"321\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Blasting_Chime_%28level_3%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Vaults_of_the_Artificers\" title=\"Vaults of the Artificers\">Vaults of the Artificers</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>A small set of chimes that greatly amplifies any sonic energy channeled through it.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817201148\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.110 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3034/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19076/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4890/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n149.47%  139.757     40 Template:IO\n100.00%   93.499      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   93.499      1 -total\n 95.39%   89.190      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 50.00%   46.751      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 49.15%   45.958      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 48.24%   45.100      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 47.25%   44.176      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.45%   20.060      5 Template:Popup\n 17.23%   16.112      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:42521-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817201148 and revision id 648901. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
